{"type": "tool_use", "timestamp": 1793896714270, "sessionID": "ses_e536c9ee6ffeuNWMb8IDEwjudX", "part": {"type": "tool", "tool": "knowledge_search_docs", "callID": "call_001d93d0cae247ffb35be71a5065a4f7", "state": {"status": "completed", "input": {"query": "PaymentsService CAPTURE_TIMEOUT default capture timeout", "k": 3}, "output": "[payments-service#Configuration]\nPaymentsService: Configuration\nIt is configured by PAYMENT_API_KEY and CAPTURE_TIMEOUT. CAPTURE_TIMEOUT is in seconds and defaults to 30.\n\n[order-service#Operations]\nOrderService: Operations\nA payment authorization that times out is retried once after two seconds. A second timeout cancels the checkout and releases the reserved stock.\n\n[payments-service#Integrations]\nPaymentsService: Integrations\nIt calls the NotificationsAPI on a declined authorization, so the customer hears about a decline even when checkout has already returned.\n\nPaymentsService is maintained by the same team as BillingService.", "metadata": {"truncated": false}, "title": "", "time": {"start": 1793896711955, "end": 1793896714233}}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "fc_0ea8af4c00443945016aecb107994087d1bc6c60d6cea0e132"}}, "id": "prt_1ac9385e8001F2FRvcHK5xtm6x", "sessionID": "ses_e536c9ee6ffeuNWMb8IDEwjudX", "messageID": "msg_1ac9379ae001i6FPS0munJ40Qh"}}
