{"type": "text", "timestamp": 1793896716940, "sessionID": "ses_e536c9ee6ffeuNWMb8IDEwjudX", "part": {"id": "prt_1ac939711001Eg66Egy2KaZvVD", "messageID": "msg_1ac93900f001xnT5BnvPHPm6va", "sessionID": "ses_e536c9ee6ffeuNWMb8IDEwjudX", "type": "text", "text": "The configuration key **`CAPTURE_TIMEOUT`** sets **PaymentsService**\u2019s capture timeout. It is measured in seconds and defaults to **30 seconds**.\n\nSource: `payments-service#Configuration`.", "time": {"start": 1793896716049, "end": 1793896716936}, "metadata": {"openai": {"itemId": "msg_045d3c0eb61cbf1f016aecb10bfdd487d1aa7ba744f2e2fdce", "phase": "final_answer"}}}}
